hadiths[43]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1068","[AI-translation] Masrooq kehtay hain ke ham ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se us aayat: Un logon ko murda mat samjho jo Allah ki raah mein qatl kiye gaye, balke wo apne Rab ke paas zinda hain, rozi diye jatay hain, ke baaray mein poocha, to Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha. Ham ne us aayat ke baaray mein, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke shaheedon ki roohein sabz parindon ke qaalib mein qandeelon ke andar hain, jo arsh-e-mubarak se latak rahi hain aur jahan chahtay hain jannat mein chugtay phirtay hain, phir apni qandeelon mein aa rehtay hain. Aik dafa un ke Parwardigaar ne un ko dekha aur farmaya ke tum kuch chahti ho? Unhon ne kaha ke ab ham kya chahein gi? Ham to jannat mein jahan chahti hain chugti phirti hain to Parwardigaar Jalla wa Ula ne teen dafa poocha. Jab unhon ne dekha ke baghair maangay hamari rihayi nahi, yani Parwardigaar Jal Jalaluhu barabar poochay jata hai, to unhon ne kaha ke Ae hamaray Parwardigaar! Ham ye chahti hain ke hamari roohon ko hamaray badanon mein pher de, yani duniya ke badanon mein, taake ham dobara teri raah mein maaray jayein. Jab un ke Rab ne dekha ke ab un ko koi khwahish nahi, to un ko chhor diya. (Muslim)."
"1069","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr bin Abdullah bin Qais apne walid se riwayat kartay hue kehtay hain ke main ne apne walid ko dushman ke saamnay, yani maidaan-e-jihad mein, ye kehtay hue suna ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai ke jannat talwaaron ke saaye ke neechay hai. Ye sun kar aik ghareeb aur mailay se kapron wala shakhs utha aur kehnay laga ke Ae Abu Musa! Tum ne, khud, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko aisa farmatay hue suna hai? Abu Musa ne, kaha: Haan. Rawi kehta hai, ye sun kar wo apne doston ki taraf gaya aur kaha ke main tum ko salam karta hun aur apni talwaar ka niyaam tor daala phir talwaar le kar dushman ki taraf gaya aur apni talwaar se dushman ko maarta raha yahan tak ke shaheed ho gaya. (Muslim: 6/45). Baab: Jihad ki targheeb aur us ki fazilat."
"1070","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala us ka zaamin hai jo us ki raah mein niklay aur na niklay magar jihad ke liye aur Allah Taala par iman rakhta ho aur us ke paighambaron ko sach janta ho. Allah Taala ne farmaya ke, aisa shakhs meri hifazat mein hai ya to main us ko jannat mein le jaun ga ya us ko us ke ghar ki taraf sawab aur maal-e-ghaneemat ke saath pher dun ga. Qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai ke koi zakhm aisa nahi jo Allah Taala ki raah mein lagay, magar ye ke wo qayamat ke din usi shakal par aaye ga jaisa duniya mein hua tha, us ka rang khoon ka sa ho ga aur khushbu mushk ki. Qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai ke agar Musalmanon par dushwaar na hota to main kabhi bhi kisi lashkar se jo Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad karta hai peechay na rehta. Lekin mere paas, sawariyon waghera ki, itni gunjaish nahi hai aur na Musalmanon ke paas, sawariyon waghera ki, wusat hai aur mere janay ki soorat mein Musalmanon ko peechay rehna dushwaar ho ga. Qasam us ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai ke main ye chahta hun ke Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad karun phir maara jaun phir jihad karun phir maara jaun phir jihad karun phir maara jaun. (Muslim: 6/33-34). (Kalim se murad zakhm hai; Muslim mein reeh nahi hai; khilaaf se murad peechay hai; sawaariyan na honay se murad hai.)"
"1071","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Sa'id! Jo Allah ke Rab honay se aur Islam ke deen honay se aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Nabi honay se raazi hua, us ke liye jannat wajib hai. Ye sun kar Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) ne taajjub kiya aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Phir farmaiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne phir farmaya aur farmaya ke aik aur amal hai jis ki wajah se banday ko jannat mein sau darjay milein ge aur har aik darja se doosray darja tak itna faasla ho ga jitna aasmaan aur zameen ke darmiyan hai. Abu Sa'id (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya ke wo kaun sa amal hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad karna, Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad karna. (Muslim: 6/37). Baab: Afzal log."
"1072","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke kaun shakhs afzal hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo shakhs jo Allah Taala ki raah mein apne maal aur apni jaan se jihad karta hai. Us ne kaha phir kaun hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo momin jo pahaar ki kisi ghaati mein Allah Taala ki ibadat karay aur logon ko apne sharr se bachaye. (Muslim: 6/39). Baab: Jo maray aur jihad na kiya aur na niyyat ki."
"1073","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs faut ho jaye aur na jihad kiya ho aur na jihad karnay ki niyyat ki ho to wo munafiqat ki aik khaslat par faut hua. Abdullah bin Sahm, rawi-e-hadees, kehtay hain ke Abdullah bin Mubarak ne kaha ke ham khayal kartay hain ke ye hadees Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay se mutaliq hai. Ye Ibn Mubarak ka mauqif hai. Allama Albani ne likha hai ke usay Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamanay ke saath khaas karnay ki koi daleel nahi hai. (Muslim: 6/49). Baab: Samandar mein jihad ki fazilat."
"1074","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Umm Haraam bint Milhan jo ke Ubada bin Samit (raziyallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thin, ke paas jatay thay, kyunke wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki mehram thin yani razai khaala ya Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke walid ya dada ki khaala. Wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khana khilatin thin. Aik roz Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas gaye, to unhon ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khana khilaya aur sar ki jooein dekhnay lagein. Usi dauran Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) so gaye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hanstay hue jagay, to Umm Haraam ne poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap kyun hanstay hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke chand log mere saamnay laaye gaye jo Allah Taala ki raah mein jihad ke liye us samandar ke beech mein sawaar ho rahay thay jaisay badshah takht par charhtay hain ya badshahon ki tarah takht par. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke Allah Taala mujhe bhi un mein se karay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dua ki phir sar rakha aur so rahay aur phir hanstay hue jagay. Main ne poocha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kyun hanstay hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke chand log mere saamnay laaye gaye jo jihad ke liye jatay thay aur bayan kiya jis tarah upar guzra. Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke Allah Taala mujhe bhi un logon mein karay, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu pehlay logon mein se ho chuki. Phir Umm Haraam bint Milhan (raziyallahu anha) Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ke daur-e-khilafat mein samandar mein, jazeera Cyprus fatah karnay ke liye, sawaar huin aur jab darya se nikalnay lagein to janwar se gir kar shaheed ho gayein. (Muslim). (Wo mehram thin; sabaj se murad samandar ka darmiyan hai.)"
"1075","[AI-translation] Salman (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke Allah ki raah mein aik din raat pehra chauki dena, aik maheena bhar rozay rakhnay aur ibadat karnay se afzal hai aur agar usi dauran faut ho jaye ga to us ka ye kaam barabar jaari rahay ga, yani us ka sawab marnay ke baad bhi mauqoof na ho ga barhta hi chala jaye ga, ye us amal se khaas hai, aur us ka rizq jaari ho jaye ga, jo shaheedon ko milta hai, aur wo fitna walon se bach jaye ga. Yani qabr mein farishton wali aazmaish ya azaab-e-qabr se ya dam-e-marg shaitaan ke waswasay se. (Muslim: 6/51). Baab: Allah ki raah mein subah ya shaam chalna duniya se behtar hai. (Fattaan se murad Munkar Nakeer ya shaitaan hain; ghadwa subah ka chalna hai.)"
"1076","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki raah mein subah ko ya shaam ko chalna duniya aur ma feeha se behtar hai. (Muslim: 6/36). Baab: Allah ke qaul ke baaray mein: Kya tum ne hajiyon ko pani pilana banaya."
"1077","[AI-translation] Numan bin Bashir (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mimbar ke paas baitha tha ke aik shakhs bola: Mujhe Musalman honay par kisi amal ki parwa nahi, jab main hajiyon ko pani pilaon. Doosra bola ke mujhe Islam ke baad kisi amal ki kya parwa hai ke main Masjid-ul-Haram ki marammat karun. Teesra bola ke un cheezon se to jihad afzal hai. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne un ko daanta aur kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mimbar ke saamnay Juma ke din apni aawazein buland na karo lekin main Juma ki namaz ke baad Aap se us baat ko jis mein tum ne ikhtilaf kiya poochun ga. Tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke: Kya tum ne hajiyon ko pani pilana aur Masjid-ul-Haram ko aabaad karna us shakhs ke aamaal jaisa samjha jo Allah aur aakhirat par iman laya aur Allah ki raah mein jihad kiya, wo Allah ke nazdeek barabar nahi, Surah Tauba: 19. (Muslim). Baab: Jo sachayi se shahadat maangay."
"1078","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Hunaif (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Allah se sachayi ke saath shahadat maangay ga to Allah Taala us ko shaheedon ka darja de ga agarchay wo apne bichhonay par hi faut ho. (Muslim: 6/49). Baab: Allah ki raah mein shahadat ki fazilat."
"1079","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs jannat mein chala jaye ga, phir us ko duniya mein aanay ki aarzu na rahay gi agarchay us ko saari zameen ki cheezein di jayein, lekin shaheed phir aanay ki aur das baar qatl honay ki aarzu karay ga us wajah se ke jo inaam o ikraam, shahadat ki wajah se, dekhay ga. Yani us ko baar baar hasil karna chahay ga. (Muslim: 6/35)"
"1080","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aamaal ka aitbaar niyyat se hai aur aadmi ke wastay wohi hai jo us ne niyyat ki. Phir jis ki hijrat Allah aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke wastay hai, to us ki hijrat Allah aur Rasool ke liye hi hai aur jis ne hijrat duniya kamanay ya kisi aurat se nikah ke liye ki, to us ki hijrat usi ke liye jis maqsad ke liye us ne hijrat ki hai. (Muslim: 6/48). Baab: Allah shaheedon se raazi aur wo us se raazi."
"1081","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kuch log Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha ke hamaray saath kuch aadmi bhejein jo hamein Quran o sunnat sikhayein. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki taraf sattar aadmi Ansaar mein se bhejay un ko Qurra, Qaari Haafiz log, kaha jata tha aur un mein mere maamun Haraam (raziyallahu anhu) bhi thay wo, Qurra, Quran padhtay thay aur ikathay baith kar raat ko aik doosray ko padhatay aur padhtay thay aur din ko pani la kar masjid mein rakh detay aur lakriyan, jungle se, la kar baichtay thay aur, us qeemat ka, khana khareedtay aur ahl-e-suffa ko khilatay thay. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko logon ke paas bhej diya, jo taleem ke liye kuch aadmi maangtay thay. Lekin unhon ne un Qurra par hamla kiya aur unhein qatl kar diya qabal is ke ke wo apni manzil par pahunchay. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah! Hamari taraf se hamaray Nabi ko pahuncha de ke ham tujh se milay aur ham tujh se raazi hue aur tu ham se raazi hua. Aur aik aadmi Haraam, Anas ke maamun, ke peechay se aaya aur unhein naiza maara yahan tak ke paar kar diya to Haraam ne kaha: Fuztu wa Rabb-il-Kaaba, main kaamyaab hua. Phir Rasoolullah ne apne ashaab se farmaya ke tumharay bhai qatl kiye gaye aur unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah! Hamari taraf se hamaray Nabi ko pahuncha de ke ham tujh se milay aur ham tujh se raazi hue aur tu ham se raazi hua. (Muslim: 6/45). Baab: Shaheed paanch hain."
"1082","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aik shakhs ja raha tha ke us ne rastay mein aik kaantay daar shaakh dekhi to, rastay se, hata di. Jis par Allah Taala ne us ka badla detay hue us ko bakhsh diya. Aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke shaheed paanch hain. Jo taoon, waba yani jo marz aam ho jaye, se faut ho jaye, jo pait ke aarizay se maray, jaisay ishaal ya paichish ya istisqa se, aur jo pani mein doob kar maray aur jo dab kar maray aur jo Allah ki raah mein maara jaye. (Muslim: 6/51). Baab: Taoon har Musalman ke liye shahadat hai. (Matoon taoon zada hai; mabtoon pait ki beemari wala hai; sahab-ul-hadam dab kar marnay wala hai.)"
"1083","[AI-translation] Hafsa bint Sireen se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujh se Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Yahya bin Abu Amra kis aarizay mein faut hue? Main ne kaha ke taoon se faut hue. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Taoon har Musalman ke liye shahadat hai. (Muslim: 6/52). Baab: Shaheed ka har gunah maaf siwae qarz ke."
"1084","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qarz ke siwa shaheed ka har gunah maaf kar diya jata hai. (Muslim: 6/38)"
"1085","[AI-translation] Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sahaba mein, khutba padhnay ko, kharay hue aur un se bayan kiya ke tamam aamaal mein afzal, amal, Allah ki raah mein jihad aur Allah Taala par iman lana hai. Aik shakhs khara hua aur bola ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar main Allah Taala ki raah mein maara jaun, to mere gunah mujh se mita diye jayein ge? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke haan agar tu Allah ki raah mein maara jaye, sabr ke saath aur teri niyyat Allah Taala ke liye khaalis ho aur tu, dushman ke, saamnay rahay peeth na moray. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu ne kya kaha? Wo bola ke agar main Allah Taala ki raah mein maara jaun to kya mere gunah mit jayein ge? Aap ne farmaya ke haan, magar qarz maaf na ho ga, ye Jibrail ne mujhe bataya hai. (Muslim: 6/38). Baab: Maal bachanay par qatl honay wala shaheed hai. (Jibrail ne kaha tha ke qarz mustasna hai.)"
"1086","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik shakhs aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Us ke baaray mein Aap kya farmatay hain ke agar koi shakhs mera maal, nahaq, lenay ko aaye, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke apna maal us ko na de. Phir us ne kaha ke agar wo mujh se laray? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya to bhi us se lar. Phir us ne kaha ke agar wo mujh ko maar daalay? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu shaheed hai. Phir us ne kaha ke agar main us ko maar daalun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo jahannam mein jaye ga. (Muslim: 1/87). Baab: Allah ke qaul ke baaray mein: Mard jinhon ne Allah se kiya waada poora kiya."
"1087","[AI-translation] Sabit kehtay hain ke Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mere chacha jin ke naam par mera naam rakha gaya hai, yani un ka naam bhi Anas tha, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Badr ki larai mein shareek nahi ho sakay thay. Aur ye amr un par bohat mushkil guzra aur unhon ne kaha ke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki pehli larai mein ghaib raha ab agar Allah Taala doosri kisi larai mein mujhe Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath kar de, to Allah Taala dekh le ga ke main kya karta hun aur us ke siwa kuch aur kehnay se daray, yani kuch aur daawa karnay se ke main aisa karun ga waisa karun ga kyunke shayad na ho sakay aur jhootay hon. Phir wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Uhud ki larai mein gaye. Rawi kehta hai ke Sa'd bin Muaz saamnay se aaye to Anas ne kaha: Ae Abu Amr! Kahan? To unhon ne kaha: Wahaan! Jannat ki khushbu pa raha hun, Uhud se paray se aa rahi hai. Phir unhon ne un se qitaal kiya yahan tak ke shaheed ho gaye. Un ke jism mein assi se zyada zakhm paye gaye, talwaar, naiza aur teer ke. Un ki behan, meri phuphi, Rubayyi bint Nazar ne kaha to main ne apne bhai ko nahi pehchana magar un ki ungli se. Aur ye aayat utri: Mard jinhon ne Allah se kiya waada poora kiya, pas un mein se koi apna waada poora kar chuka aur koi intezar mein hai aur unhon ne tabdeel nahi kiya, Surah Ahzab: 23. Log samajhtay thay ke ye aayat un ke aur un ke saathiyon ke baaray mein utri. (Muslim: 6/45). Baab: Jo Allah ka kalima buland karnay ko laray. (Un ke naam Anas bin Nazar hain; wahaan se murad khushi hai.)"
"1088","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ashari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehati aadmi Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Aadmi loot ke liye larta hai aur aadmi naam ke liye larta hai aur aadmi apna martaba dikhanay ko larta hai to Allah Taala ki raah mein larna kaun sa hai? Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo is liye laray ke Allah Taala ka kalima buland ho, wo Allah ki raah mein larta hai. (Muslim: 6/46)"
"1089","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Yasar kehtay hain ke log Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas se juda hue to Naatil, jo ke ahl-e-Shaam mein se tha, Naatil bin Qais Khurami ye Falasteen ka rehnay wala tha aur Tabi hai us ka baap sahabi tha, ne kaha ke Ae Shaikh! Mujh se aisi hadees bayan karo jo tum ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suni ho. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke acha main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke qayamat mein pehle jis ka faisla ho ga wo aik shakhs ho ga jo shaheed ho gaya tha. Jab us ko Allah Taala ke paas laya jaye ga to Allah Taala apni nemat us ko batlaye ga aur wo pehchanay ga. Allah Taala poochay ga ke tu ne us ke liye kya amal kiya hai? Wo bolay ga ke main teri raah mein larta raha yahan tak ke shaheed ho gaya. Allah Taala farmaye ga ke tu ne jhoot kaha. Tu is liye lara tha ke log tujhe bahadur kahein. Aur tujhe bahadur kaha gaya. Phir hukm ho ga aur us ko aundhay munh ghaseet kar jahannam mein daal diya jaye ga. Aur aik shakhs ho ga jis ne deen ka ilm seekha aur sikhlaya aur Quran padha us ko Allah Taala ke paas laya jaye ga. Allah Taala us ko apni nematein dikhlaye ga, wo shakhs pehchan le ga tab kaha jaye ga ke tu ne us ke liye kya amal kiya hai? Wo kahay ga ke main ne ilm padha aur padhaya aur Quran padha. Allah Taala farmaye ga ke tu jhoot bolta hai tu ne is liye ilm padha tha ke log tujhe aalim kahein aur Quran tu ne is liye padha tha ke log tujhe qaari kahein, duniya mein tujh ko aalim aur qaari kaha gaya. Phir hukm ho ga aur us ko munh ke bal ghaseet kar jahannam mein daal diya jaye ga. Aur aik shakhs ho ga jis ko Allah Taala ne har tarah ka maal diya tha, wo Allah Taala ke paas laya jaye ga. Allah Taala us ko apni nematein dikhlaye ga aur wo pehchan le ga, to Allah Taala poochay ga ke tu ne us ke liye kya amal kiye? Wo kahay ga ke main ne tere liye maal kharch karnay ki koi raah aisi nahi chhori jis mein tu kharch karna pasand karta tha magar main ne us mein kharch kiya. Allah Taala farmaye ga ke tu jhoota hai, tu ne is liye kharch kiya ke log tujhe sakhi kahein, to logon ne tujhe duniya mein sakhi keh diya. Phir hukm ho ga aur usay munh ke bal khainch kar jahannam mein daal diya jaye ga. (Muslim: 6/47). Baab: Qitaal par zyada ajar. (Naatil-e-Shaam se murad Naatil bin Qais hai.)"
"1090","[AI-translation] Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Bani Nabeet, jo Ansaar ka aik qabeela hai, ka aik shakhs aaya aur kehnay laga ke main gawahi deta hun ke Allah Taala ke siwa koi ibadat ke laiq nahi aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke banday aur us ke paigham pahunchanay walay hain. Phir aagay barha aur larta raha, yahan tak ke maara gaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ne amal thora kiya aur sawab bohat paya. (Muslim: 6/44). Baab: Jo ghazwa karay aur zakhmi ho ya maal paye."
"1091","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi lashkar ya fauj ka tukra jihad karay, phir ghaneemat hasil karay aur salamat rahay, to us ko aakhirat ke sawab mein se do tihayi duniya mein mil gaya aur jo lashkar ya fauj ka tukra khaali haath aaye aur nuqsan uthaye, yani zakhmi ho jaye ya maara jaye, to us ko aakhirat mein poora sawab milay ga. (Muslim: 6/48). Baab: Ghazi ka samaan karnay walay ka ajar."
"1092","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne kisi ghazi ka Allah ki raah mein samaan kar diya, us ne jihad kiya aur jis ne ghazi ke gharbaar ki khabar rakhi, us ne bhi jihad kiya, yani us ne jihad ka sawab kamaya. (Muslim: 6/42)"
"1093","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke qabeela Aslam ke aik jawan ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main jihad ka irada rakhta hun aur mere paas samaan nahi hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke falan ke paas jao us ne jihad ka samaan kiya tha magar wo shakhs beemar ho gaya. Wo us shakhs ke paas gaya aur kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tujhe salam kaha hai aur farmaya hai ke wo samaan mujhe de de. Us ne, apni biwi ya londi se kaha ke, Ae falan! Wo sab samaan us ko de de aur koi cheez mat rakh. Allah ki qasam koi cheez na rakh kyunke tere liye us mein barkat ho gi. (Muslim: 6/41). Baab: Mujahideen ki hurmat."
"1094","[AI-translation] Sulaiman bin Buraida apne walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujahideen ki auraton ki hurmat ghar mein rehnay walon par aisi hai jaisay un ki maaon ki hurmat aur jo shakhs ghar mein reh kar kisi mujahid ke gharbaar ki khabargiri karay, phir us mein khayanat karay, to wo qayamat ke din khara kiya jaye ga aur mujahid se kaha jaye ga ke us ke amal mein se jo chahay le le. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke, tumhara kya khayal hai? (Muslim: 6/42-43). Baab: Allah ke qaul ke baaray mein: Meri ummat ka aik giroh haq par ghalib rahay ga. (Muslim mein bihi nahi hai; riwayat mein hai ke apni nekiyon mein se jitna chahay le le.)"
"1095","[AI-translation] Sauban (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka aik giroh hamesha haq par qaim rahay ga, koi un ko nuqsan na pahuncha sakay ga, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ka hukm aaye, yani qayamat, aur wo usi haal mein hon ge, yani ghalib aur haq par hon ge. (Muslim: 6/52-53). (Amr-e-Ilahi se murad wo hawa hai jo mominon ki rooh qabz karay gi; taifa se murad ahl-e-hadees hain.)"
"1096","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Shimasa Mahri kehtay hain ke main Maslama bin Mukhallad ke paas baitha tha aur un ke paas Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (raziyallahu anhuma) bhi thay. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qayamat qaim na ho gi magar badtareen makhlooq par aur wo badtar hon ge jahiliyat walon se. Allah Taala se jis baat ki dua karein ge Allah Taala un ko de de ga. Wo usi haal mein thay ke Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) aaye to Maslama ne un se kaha ke Ae Uqba! Tum ne suna ke Abdullah kya kehtay hain? Uqba (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wo mujh se zyada jantay hain, lekin main ne to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna hai, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke meri ummat ka aik giroh ya aik jamaat hamesha Allah Taala ke hukm par larti rahay gi, aur apne dushman par ghalib rahay gi. Jo koi un ki mukhalifat karay ga un ko nuqsan na pahuncha sakay ga, yahan tak ke qayamat aa jaye gi aur wo usi haal mein hon ge. Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke beshak, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aisa farmaya. Phir Allah Taala aik hawa bhejay ga jis mein mushk ki si boo ho gi aur resham ki tarah badan par lagay gi, wo kisi shakhs ko na chhoray gi jis ke dil mein aik daanay ke barabar bhi iman ho ga magar us ko maut aa jaye gi. Us ke baad sab buray, kafir, log reh jayein ge, unhi par qayamat qaim ho gi. (Muslim: 6/54). Baab: Maghrib walay haq par ghalib rahein ge. (Ahl-e-gharb se murad Shaam walay hain.)"
"1097","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hamesha maghrib walay, yani Arab ya Shaam walay, haq par ghalib rahein ge, yahan tak ke qayamat qaim ho gi. (Muslim: 6/54)"
"1098","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jal do shakhson ko dekh kar hansta hai ke aik ne doosray ko qatl kiya, phir donon jannat mein gaye. Logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye kaisay ho ga? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs Allah Taala ki raah mein lartay hue shaheed hua. Ab jis ne us ko shaheed kiya tha, wo Musalman hua aur Allah Taala ki raah mein lara aur shaheed hua. (Muslim: 6/40). Baab: Jo kafir ko qatl karay phir naik rahay wo aag mein na jaye ga."
"1099","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Donon jahannam mein us tarah ikattha na hon ge ke aik doosray ko nuqsan pahuncha dein. Logon ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Wo kaun log hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo Musalman kafir ko qatl karay, phir neki par qaim rahay. (Muslim: 6/41). Baab: Jo Allah ki raah mein oontni par sawaar karay us ki fazilat. (Saddada se murad neki par qaim rehna hai; warid-e-jahannam se murad guzarna hai.)"
"1100","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik shakhs aik oontni nakeel samet laya aur kehnay laga ke ye main Allah Taala ki raah mein deta hun, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us ke badlay tujhe qayamat ke din nakeel pari hui saat sau oontniyan milein gi. (Muslim: 6/41)"
"1101","[AI-translation] Abu Mas'ud Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik shakhs Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mera, sawaari ka, janwar jata raha, ab mujhe sawaari dijiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas sawaari nahi hai. Aik shakhs bola Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main usay wo shakhs batla dun jo sawaari de ga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo koi neki ki raah bataye, us ko itna hi sawab hai jitna neki karnay walay ko hai. (Muslim: 6/41). Baab: Mimbar par teerandazi ki targheeb."
"1102","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mimbar par Allah Taala ke farman: Kafiron ke liye zor ki tayyari karo jitni taqat ho, Surah Anfal: 60, ki tafseer bayan kartay hue suna. Aap farma rahay thay: Khabardaar raho ke zor se murad teerandazi hai, khabardaar raho ke zor se murad teerandazi hai, phir, khabardaar raho ke zor se murad teerandazi hai. (Muslim: 6/52). Baab: Teerandazi par ubharna."
"1103","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke, chand roz mein, anqareeb kai mulk tumharay haath par fatah hon ge aur Allah Taala tumharay liye kaafi ho jaye ga phir koi tum mein se apne teeron ka khail na chhoray, yani nishana baazi seekhay: Pistol se, Kalashnikov se, Rocket aur Missile waghera se. (Muslim: 6/52). (Yakfeekum se murad dushman se kifayat hai.)"
"1104","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Shimasa se riwayat hai ke Fuqaim Lakhmi ne Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke us burhapay mein tum un donon nishanon mein aatay jatay ho, tum par mushkil hota ho ga. Uqba (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se aik baat na suni hoti, to main ye mashaqqat na uthata. Haris ne kaha ke main ne Ibn Shimasa se poocha ke wo kya baat thi? Unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo koi nishana baazi seekh kar chhor de, wo ham mein se nahi hai ya gunahgaar hai. (Muslim: 6/52). Baab: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein qayamat tak khair hai. (Lam uaanihi mein Muslim mein ya hazaf hai; nasiya peshani ke baal hain.)"
"1105","[AI-translation] Jarir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik ghoray ki peshani ke baal ungli se mal rahay thay aur farmatay thay ke ghoron ki peshaniyon se qayamat tak barkat bandhi hui hai yani sawab aur ghaneemat, duniya aur aakhirat donon ki bhalayi. (Muslim: 6/32)"
"1106","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ghoron ki peshaniyon mein barkat hai. (Muslim: 6/32). Baab: Ghoron mein shikaal ki karahat."
"1107","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bura shikaal ghoray ko bura jantay thay. Aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke shikaal ghora wo hai jis ka daahna paon aur baayan haath safed ho ya daahna haath aur baayan paon safed ho. Aur ahl-e-lughat ke nazdeek sahih ye hai ke shikaal us ghoray ko kehtay hain jis ke teen paon safaidi walay hon upar safaidi na ho. (Muslim: 6/33). (Shikaal se murad teen safed paon hain.)"
"1108","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un tazmeer shuda ghoron ki Hafya se Saniyat-ul-Wida tak daur karayi, un donon maqamon mein paanch ya chhe meel ka faasla hai aur baaz ne kaha ke chhe ya saat meel ka, aur ghair tazmeer shuda ghoron ki daur Saniya se Bani Zuraiq ki masjid tak muqarrar ki aur Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) un logon mein thay jinhon ne ghor sawaari mein muqabla kiya tha. (Muslim: 6/31). Baab: Uzr se peechay rehnay walon ke baaray mein. (Hafya Madina ka maqam hai; ghair-uli-zarar ka izafa yahan be-maani hai.)"
"1109","[AI-translation] Abu Ishaq kehtay hain ke unhon ne Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se suna wo us aayat: Ghar baithnay walay aur larnay walay Musalman barabar nahi hain, yani larnay walon ka darja bohat bara hai, ke baaray mein kehtay thay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zaid ko hukm diya wo aik haddi le kar aaye aur us par ye aayat likhi. Tab Abdullah bin Umm Maktoom ne apni nabinayi ki shikayat ki, yani main andha hun is liye jihad mein nahi ja sakta to mera darja ghata rahay ga. Us waqt ye alfaaz utray: Wo log jo mazoor nahi hain, aur mazoor to darja mein mujahideen ke barabar hon ge. (Muslim: 6/43). Baab: Jo beemari se jihad se ruk jaye."
"1110","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik larai mein thay ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Madina mein chand log aisay hain jab tum chaltay ho ya kisi waadi ko tay kartay ho to wo tumharay saath hain, yani un ko wohi sawab hota hai jo tum ko hota hai. Ye wo log hain, jo beemari ki wajah se tumharay saath na aa sakay. (Muslim: 6/49). (Muslim mein lirajulan hai.)"
